ex:C076P0027 a ct:SourcePassage ;
    ct:end_char 14007 ;
    ct:exact_text "Best or a substitute agency, which is a nationally        recognized statistical rating organization, for a rating that is equal        to or better than the Company's then-current rating on the date        immediately preceding such sale. To the extent not terminated previously        by AIG pursuant to the foregoing, this Agreement will terminate        automatically one year after the closing of any sale of the Company by        AIG, and all provisions hereof will be of no further force and effect.        For the avoidance of doubt, the termination of this Agreement pursuant        to this paragraph 8 shall not relieve either party of any obligation it        may owe to the other party hereunder that existed prior to, and remains        outstanding as of, the Termination Date." ;
